The MIT License in LICENSE covers the source code and documentation in this
repository. It does not cover the pack art: the textures and pack icons the
build produces, and the preview image(s) in docs/ (docs/enchanter-preview.png),
are derived from Mojang's Minecraft assets. Their use is governed by Mojang's
Minecraft Usage Guidelines (https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/usage-guidelines)
and the Minecraft EULA, not by the MIT License.

This repository contains no Mojang files. The build downloads the official
Minecraft client jar from Mojang at build time and derives the pack art from it.

The mobs pack takes nothing from the client jar. Its art is this project's own:
the three illager-face textures (packs/mobs/files/assets/bettermodel/textures/
item/*_illager_face.png) are original stand-ins, not copies of Mojang's. Its
items atlas (packs/mobs/files/assets/minecraft/atlases/items.json) contains no
pixels: it only references the vanilla texture minecraft:entity/illager/pillager
by name, which the player's own client reads from its own assets at runtime.

